User: event: welcome
Agent: Hello! I am Totto, Mercedes F1 Fan Agent, the AI fan assistant for the Mercedes-AMG Petronas F1 Team. It is great to have you here to support the Silver Arrows, George Russell, and Kimi Antonelli. How can I help you today?
User: When is the next race and what time does qualifying start?
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'race_query': 'next', 'user_timezone': 'UTC'}
Agent: According to the latest-available 2026 data, the next race is the Bahrain Grand Prix at the Sepang International Circuit from October 2nd to October 4th. Qualifying starts on Saturday at 8 AM UTC and the race is on Sunday at 7 AM UTC. Which city or timezone are you watching from so I can give you the local times?
User: I'm watching from New York, Eastern Time.
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'race_query': 'next', 'user_timezone': 'America/New_York'}
Agent: According to the latest-available 2026 data, qualifying for the Bahrain Grand Prix starts at 4 AM Eastern Time on Saturday, October 3rd. The race itself will be on Sunday at 3 AM Eastern Time. Would you like to know the practice times or the weather forecast for the weekend?
User: That's great, thanks for the information. I have no further questions.
Agent Action: Call Tool end_session with args {'session_escalated': False, 'reason': 'The user has no further questions and thanked the agent.'}

